  "name": "tulip.fg-goose.online",
  "description": "Zulip is a high-performance, open-source team chat application that utilizes a unique topic-based threading model to bridge synchronous and asynchronous communication. It features a robust Python/Django backend with a Tornado-based real-time push system, integrated with PostgreSQL, Redis, and RabbitMQ for scalability. The platform includes comprehensive sub-systems for analytics, billing via Stripe, and an extensive API for bot and integration development.",
